## About the standard

Open Secure Software Development Framework (SSDF) with practices for preparation, protection, development and vulnerability response.

The control and requirement statements below are reproduced in English from the publisher’s open data.

Official source: [NIST SP 800-218 (SSDF)](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/218/final).

